      "content": "stop falling? i'm not sure i follow. what does that even look like? you're saying i should just walk away from everything, but i don't mean just moving away. it feels like the only way to actually take control and keep my dignity is to just... end the story before it gets any uglier. is that even a logical way to think about it? or am i just losing it?",
